# Frontend configuration.
#
# There is exactly one variable, and it is not a secret. Everything Vite inlines
# here ends up readable in the deployed JavaScript, which is why no AWS
# credential may ever appear in this file again - the API holds them now, under
# its own execution role.

# Base URL of the MFTournament API, printed as ApiUrl when you deploy server/.
# Example: https://abc123.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
